1
00:00:00,973 --> 00:00:02,403
(Amy:)So, how do we start?

2
00:00:02,407 --> 00:00:04,707
(Emily:)We have to look for the clues
hidden around the room.

3
00:00:04,710 --> 00:00:06,310
(Raj:)Uh, wasn't there
supposed to be a zombie?

4
00:00:06,311 --> 00:00:08,341
(growling)
(yelling)

5
00:00:08,347 --> 00:00:09,617
Ooh!

6
00:00:10,883 --> 00:00:12,753
(Raj:)Okay, let's hope
one of the clues

7
00:00:12,751 --> 00:00:14,951
(Raj:)is written on a pair
of clean underwear.

8
00:00:17,389 --> 00:00:19,219
(Clerk:)Mr. and Mrs. Wolowitz?

9
00:00:19,223 --> 00:00:21,053
(Clerk:)As far as I can tell,
your bag arrived in Los Angeles.

10
00:00:21,059 --> 00:00:22,659
(Bernadette:)So, where is it?

11
00:00:22,661 --> 00:00:24,431
(Clerk:)I don't know, perhaps somebody

12
00:00:24,429 --> 00:00:26,329
(Clerk:)took it off the carousel
by mistake?

13
00:00:26,331 --> 00:00:29,531
(Howard:)So, some stranger has my mom?

14
00:00:29,535 --> 00:00:31,435
(Howard:)Is that what you're telling me?

15
00:00:31,436 --> 00:00:35,176
(Howard:)My poor mother can be anywhere
in Los Angeles right now?

16
00:00:35,173 --> 00:00:37,773
I-I wish I was telling you that.

17
00:00:37,776 --> 00:00:39,246
(Sheldon:)Um...

18
00:00:39,244 --> 00:00:40,414
(Clerk:)but the passenger
could've gotten

19
00:00:40,412 --> 00:00:42,282
(Clerk:)on an international flight.

20
00:00:42,281 --> 00:00:44,451
Oh, okay, great!

21
00:00:44,449 --> 00:00:46,979
(Howard:)So, your entire job is
to find lost luggage,

22
00:00:46,985 --> 00:00:48,555
(Howard:)and you've narrowed
down the location

23
00:00:48,554 --> 00:00:51,684
(Howard:)of my mother to
the planet Earth!

24
00:00:51,690 --> 00:00:53,160
I'm sorry!

25
00:00:53,158 --> 00:00:55,588
W-Would 500
frequent-flyer miles help?

26
00:00:55,594 --> 00:01:00,024
(Clerk:)That could get you
to Sacramento.

